icle></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white px-5 py-24 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-32\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-orange-600\">The three-second AP view</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-balance text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.045em] sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-slate-950\">Understand the building state in three seconds.</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-balance text-base leading-8 sm:text-lg text-slate-600\">Five signals. One clear order of attention.</p></div><div class=\"mt-16 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><article class=\"min-h-56 rounded-[1.75rem] p-7 bg-slate-950 text-white shadow-[0_28px_80px_rgba(15,23,42,0.2)] md:col-span-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-orange-300\">Top priority</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert h-5 w-5 text-orange-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"mt-12 font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-4xl sm:text-5xl\">Overdue pass</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400\">Cafeteria Hall · 4m</p></article><article class=\"min-h-56 rounded-[1.75rem] p-7 border border-slate-200 bg-[#fbfaf8] text-slate-950\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500\">Active incidents</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity h-5 w-5 text-slate-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"mt-12 font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-3xl\">2</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500\">1 assigned · 1 validating</p></article><article class=\"min-h-56 rounded-[1.75rem] p-7 border border-slate-200 bg-[#fbfaf8] text-slate-950\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500\">Attendance / pass</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check h-5 w-5 text-slate-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"mt-12 font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-3xl\">18 active</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500\">1 needs review</p></article><article class=\"min-h-56 rounded-[1.75rem] p-7 border border-slate-200 bg-[#fbfaf8] text-slate-950\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500\">Receiver health</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart-pulse h-5 w-5 text-slate-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3