rder border-slate-300 bg-white/65 px-4 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 shadow-sm -rotate-1\">Radios</div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-300 bg-white/65 px-4 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 shadow-sm translate-y-2 rotate-1\">Paper passes</div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-300 bg-white/65 px-4 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 shadow-sm -translate-y-1\">Hall cameras</div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-300 bg-white/65 px-4 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 shadow-sm -rotate-1\">Staff memory</div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-300 bg-white/65 px-4 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 shadow-sm translate-y-2 rotate-1\">Disconnected reports</div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-300 bg-white/65 px-4 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 shadow-sm -translate-y-1\">Unclear follow-up</div></div><p class=\"mt-10 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500\">Context gets reconstructed after the moment has already moved on.</p></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-slate-950 p-7 text-white shadow-[0_34px_90px_rgba(15,23,42,0.22)] sm:p-9\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(24px)\"><div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-orange-600/20 blur-[90px]\"></div><p class=\"relative text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-orange-300\">With Valkor</p><div class=\"relative mt-8 space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.06] px-4 py-4\"><span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500/15 text-orange-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Pass state</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.06] px-4 py-4\"><span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500/15 text-orange-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Zone context</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.06] px-4 py-4\"><span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500/15 text-orange-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Receiver health</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.06] px-4 py-4\"><span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500/15 text-orange-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Assigned response</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.06] px-4 py-4\"><span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500/15 text-orange-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Action history</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.06] px-4 py-4\"><span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500/15 text-orange-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Pilot proof</span></div></div><p class=\"relative mt-8 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">One state. Clear ownership. A record of what happened next.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white px-5 py-24 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-32\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr] lg:gap-20\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-orange-600\">Pilot proof</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-balance text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.045em] sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-slate-950\">The pilot ends with evidence.</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-balance text-base leading-8 sm:text-lg text-slate-600\">Valkor measures whether the system was reliable, useful, and worthy of expansion—not whether the demo looked impressive.</p></div><article class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-[#fbfaf8] shadow-[0_32px_100px_rgba(15,23,42,0.12)]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 border-b border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm