v></div></div><div><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-6\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-600\">False alerts</p><p class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950\"><span>0</span></p></div><div class=\"mt-3 h-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-slate-200\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-orange-500\" style=\"width:0px\"></div></div></div><div><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-6\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-600\">Route deviations reviewed</p><p class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950\"><span>0</span></p></div><div class=\"mt-3 h-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-slate-200\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-orange-500\" style=\"width:0px\"></div></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-6 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div><p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.17em] text-slate-400\">Average response time</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-950\">1m 42s</p></div><div><p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.17em] text-slate-400\">Recommendation</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-slate-950\">Retest east hallway receiver placement</p></div></div></div></article></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-slate-200 bg-[#fbfaf8] px-5 py-24 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-28\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-orange-600\">Trust and privacy</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-balance text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.045em] sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-slate-950\">Built with clear boundaries.</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-balance text-base leading-8 sm:text-lg text-slate-600\">The trust model supports the product. It does not have to overshadow it.</p></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border 