</div></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold transition duration-300 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange-500/70 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-white border border-orange-500/20 bg-orange-600 text-white shadow-lg shadow-orange-600/20 hover:bg-orange-700 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-orange-600/25 active:translate-y-px \" href=\"/command-center\">View Product Demo<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold transition duration-300 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange-500/70 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-white border border-slate-200/80 bg-white/[0.88] text-slate-900 shadow-sm shadow-slate-200/60 backdrop-blur hover:border-slate-300 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-md active:translate-y-px \" href=\"#request-pilot\">Request Pilot Review</a></div></div></section><section id=\"request-pilot\" class=\"relative isolate scroll-mt-24 overflow-hidden bg-[#060b14] px-5 py-24 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-32\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -left-20 top-1/4 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-orange-600/15 blur-[120px]\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr] lg:items-start lg:gap-20\"><div class=\"lg:sticky lg:top-32\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-orange-300\">Limited pilot review</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-balance text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.045em] text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl\">Prove the value in a controlled scope.</h2><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-8 text-slate-300 sm:text-lg\">Start with two to four defined zones, approved badges, authorized staff, and clear success criteria.</p><div class=\"mt-9 space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200\"><span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500/15 text-orange-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>4–6 week review</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200\"><span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500/15 text-orange-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>10–30 approved badges</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200\"><span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500/15 text-orange-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Reliability and privacy feedback</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200\"><span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500/15 text-orange-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Expand, retest, or stop</div></div></div><form noValidate=\"\" class=\"rounded-[1.75rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 text-slate-950 shadow-2xl shadow-black/20 sm:p-7\"><div class=\"mb-6\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950\">Limited pilot request</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Share the basics and Valkor will follow up with a limited pilot review path.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\"><label class=\"block \"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700\">Name</span><div class=\"mt-2\"><input class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-base text-slate-950 shadow-sm shadow-slate-200/40 outline-none transition placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:border-cyan-600 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-cyan-100\" autoComplete=\"name\" required=\"\" name=\"name\"/></div></label><label class=\"block \"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700\">Role</span><div class=\"mt-2\"><input class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-base text-slate-950 shadow-sm shadow-slate-200/40 outline-none transition placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:border-cyan-600 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-cyan-100\" autoComplete=\"organization-title\" required=\"\" name=\"role\"/></div></label><label class=\"block \"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700\">School / district</span><div class=\"mt-2\"><input class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-base text-slate-950 shadow-sm shadow-slate-200/40 outline-none transition placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:border-cyan-600 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-cyan-100\" autoComplete=\"organization\" required=\"\" name=\"school_district\"/></div></label><label class=\"block \"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700\">Email</span><div class=\"mt-2\"><input class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-base text-slate-950 shadow-sm shadow-slate-200/40 outline-none transition placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:border-cyan-600 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-cyan-100\" type=\"email\" autoComplete=\"email\" required=\"\" name=\"email\"/></div></label><label class=\"block \"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700\">Phone</span><div class=\"mt-2\"><input class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-base text-slate-950 shadow-sm shadow-slate-200/40 outline-none transition placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:border-cyan-600 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-cyan-100\" type=\"tel\" autoComplete=\"tel\" name=\"phone\"/></div></label><label class=\"block \"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700\">School size</span><div class=\"mt-2\"><input class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-base text-slate-950 shadow-sm shadow-slate-200/40 outline-none transition placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:border-cyan-600 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-cyan-100\" placeholder=\"Example: 650 students\" name=\"school_size\"/></div></label><label class=\"block \"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700\">Primary operational concern</span><div class=\"mt-2\"><select class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-base text-slate-950 shadow-sm shadow-slate-200/40 outline-none transition placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:border-cyan-600 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-cyan-100\" name=\"main_concern\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Select operational concern</option><option>Hallway pass accountability</option><option>Attendance reconciliation</option><option>Incident workflow / staff response</option><option>Device and infrastructure accountability</option><option>Pilot reliability review</option><option>Other operational concer